introduce yourself to someone at work, you use words like:<br /><br />\u201cHi, I'm (name) . I work in the (job type) department.\u201d", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"content": "engenn4le18ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to evaluate ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to judge the performance of an employee", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Every employee should expect the boss to evaluate them once a year.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le18ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you have a conversation with your boss.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "job performance ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "how well an employee does his job ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your boss would look at your job performance in the first few months.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le18ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "prompt", "type": "name"}, {"content": " on time ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's important to be prompt for work every day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le18ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I'll get on it ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "I will do this task right away ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Manager</span>: You need to be familiar with all the recipes. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Chef</span>: Sure. I'll get on it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le18ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to familiarize ", "type": "name"}, {"co